# XCU stty
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The utility acts on the terminal that is its standard input, and the driver
# gives scripts none. Nothing about its operands can be observed without
# changing a terminal, so the page is recorded as untestable.

assertion  XCU.stty.001
anchor     utilities/stty.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     utilities/stty.html#OPTIONS
anchor     utilities/stty.html#OPERANDS
anchor     utilities/stty.html#STDOUT
class      untestable
says       stty without operands reports settings, -a reports all of them, -g
           writes a one-line form that restores them, and the operands change
           the control, input, output and local modes, the special characters
           and the combination modes.
reason     It needs a terminal as standard input whose settings the test may read
           and change; the driver supplies none and a test must not alter a
           person's terminal.
